1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,790
Chandler! Chandler!
錢德！錢德

2
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,800
I saw what you were doing in the window!
錢德，我從窗戶看見了

3
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:14,030
I saw what you're doing to my sister! Get out here!
我看見你在對我妹做什麼了 你給我出來

4
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:17,540
Listen,we had a good run.
聽著，我們玩得很開心

5
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,110
What was it? Four,five months?
總共4個月？5個月？

6
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:23,380
That's more than most people have in a lifetime. Goodbye.
比很多人一輩子加起來都久 再見，保重，再見了

7
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,380
-What are you doing? -I am going on the lam.
你幹什麼？ 我要落跑

8
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:31,550
Come on,Chandler. I can handle Ross.
過來，我應付得了羅斯

9
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:33,650
Hold on!
等一下

10
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,320
Hey,Ross. What's up,bro?
羅斯老哥，你好嗎？

11
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:44,540
What the hell are you doing?
你幹了什麼好事？ 

12
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:45,800
What's going on?
發生什麼事了？

13
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:50,070
I think Ross knows about me and Monica.
我想… 羅斯發現我和摩妮卡的事了

14
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:53,810
Dude,he's right there.
他人就在那裡

15
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:59,080
I thought you were my best friend! This is my sister!
我以為你是我最好的朋友 這是我妹妹

16
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:02,360
My best friend and my sister! I cannot believe this!
我最要好的朋友和我妹妹 我真不敢相信

17
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:06,360
We're not just messing around. I love her.
我們不是玩玩而已，我愛她 

18
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:08,320
I'm in love with her.
我愛著她

19
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:12,390
I'm so sorry that you had to find out this way.
抱歉讓你這樣發現

20
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:16,670
I'm sorry, but it's true. I love him too.
對不起，但是真的，我也愛他

21
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:25,600
My best friend and my sister!
我最要好的朋友和我妹妹

22
00:01:28,750 --> 00:01:30,910
I cannot believe this!
我真不敢相信

23
00:01:33,190 --> 00:01:36,620
You guys want to probably get some hugs in too. Big news!
你們也想抱抱吧？大消息喔

24
00:01:38,130 --> 00:01:40,190
We've actually known for a while.
我們知道一陣子了

25
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,790
What? You guys knew?
什麼？你們知道？

26
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:49,690
You all knew and you didn't tell me?
你們都知道，卻沒告訴我？

27
00:01:49,970 --> 00:01:55,100
We were worried about you. We didn't know how you were going to react.
我們很擔心你 不知道你會有什麼反應

28
00:01:58,110 --> 00:02:00,980
You were worried about me?
你們擔心我？ 

29
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:03,580
You didn't know how I'd react?
不知道我會有什麼反應？

30
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,990
Okay. All right.
好吧

31
00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:13,280
Let's clear out of here and let these lovebirds get back to business.
我們要不要清個場 讓這對小情人繼續辦事？

32
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:20,290
I'm just talking here. He's the one doing your sister.
我只是說說，上你妹妹的是他

33
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,600
The One With the Girl Who Hits Joey
本集播出：「情海生波」

00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,600
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

34
00:02:58,711 --> 00:03:00,136
「中央咖啡館」

35
00:03:00,710 --> 00:03:02,440
You know what I just realized?
你們猜我想到什麼 

36
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,110
If you guys have kids
要是你們生了小孩…

37
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:05,610
We're having kids?
我們生小孩？ 

38
00:03:05,780 --> 00:03:06,970
I call godfather!
教父是我的

39
00:03:08,850 --> 00:03:11,880
You can't just call godfather.
哪能這樣用說的

40
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:15,020
Shouldn't her brother be godfather?
你不覺得應該由她哥哥當嗎？

41
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:17,690
Sure. If you cared enough to call it first.
當然，你有心就應該先喊

42
00:03:19,290 --> 00:03:23,560
-You're a few steps ahead of us. -Big zero gravity moon steps.
你們想得太遠了 十萬八千里的遠

43
00:03:24,030 --> 00:03:26,900
I just thought of the greatest wedding gift.
我剛想到一樣最棒的結婚禮物

44
00:03:27,170 --> 00:03:29,800
I'll go in on that with you. I couldn't decide.
我跟你送，我什麼都想不到

45
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:33,700
Hey,Katie.
凱蒂

46
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,300
This is Katie.
各位，這是凱蒂

47
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:36,870
You ready to go?
可以走了嗎？

48
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,880
I'll run to the bathroom.
可以，我先上個廁所 往後走

49
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:40,170
Where's lunch?
我們午餐要吃什麼？ 

50
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:42,210
I was thinking Chinese food.
我想吃中國菜

51
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:43,880
I love Chinese!
我最愛吃中國菜了

52
00:03:44,150 --> 00:03:46,710
How did you know I love Chinese?
你怎麼知道我愛吃中國菜？

53
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:51,860
She is so cute.
她真可愛，

54
00:03:52,090 --> 00:03:54,080
You could fit her in your pocket.
可以塞進口袋裡

55
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,830
She could fit in that little pocket inside the pocket.
可以塞進口袋的小口袋裡

56
00:04:00,770 --> 00:04:04,760
I don't know. I like her a lot, and she's really nice,but....
我不知道，我很喜歡她 她人很好，但是… 

58
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:06,530
But what?
但是怎樣？

59
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:10,180
She keeps punching me.
她老愛打我

60
00:04:12,310 --> 00:04:15,110
In the cute,little sweet way she just did?
用她剛才那種可愛的方式？

61
00:04:15,350 --> 00:04:17,880
It's a lot harder than it looks.
力道比表面上大多了，好嗎？ 

62
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:21,450
She's hurting me.
她把我打痛了

63
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:24,650
I know what you need. You need a bodyguard.
我知道了，你需要保鏢

64
00:04:24,890 --> 00:04:26,860
What is Ben doing after preschool?
羅斯，班下課之後有事嗎？

65
00:04:29,130 --> 00:04:33,360
Joey is having a problem. A little girl is beating him up.
別這樣，喬伊有煩惱 他被個小女孩揍了

67
00:04:35,140 --> 00:04:36,300
Joey,come here.
喬伊，過來 

68
00:04:36,540 --> 00:04:39,900
Honey,I know. This must be really difficult for you,and
我知道你一定非常難受…

69
00:04:40,210 --> 00:04:41,840
I'm sorry,am I hurting you?
抱歉，我握痛你了嗎？

70
00:04:53,590 --> 00:04:55,720
I brought you some housewarming gifts.
我帶了喬遷之禮來

71
00:04:55,990 --> 00:04:58,360
Salt, so your life always has flavor.
鹽，讓你的生活有味

72
00:04:59,090 --> 00:05:01,690
Bread, so you never go hungry.
麵包，讓你永不飢餓

73
00:05:02,230 --> 00:05:04,890
And a scented candle for the bathroom.
浴室用香精蠟燭

74
00:05:05,170 --> 00:05:06,690
Because,well,you know.
你知道的

75
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:12,100
Thanks. Thanks. And thanks,I guess.
謝謝，謝謝…再次感謝

76
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:17,910
Welcome. I'm Steve Cera, president of the tenants' committee.
歡迎你搬進來 我是史提夫沙拉，管委會主席

77
00:05:18,110 --> 00:05:21,010
Ross Geller. And this is my friend Phoebe.
你好，我是羅斯蓋勒 這是我朋友菲比

78
00:05:21,950 --> 00:05:23,750
Mr. President.
你好 主席先生

79
00:05:25,190 --> 00:05:27,280
I came to talk to you about Howard.
我來跟你談霍華的事

80
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,220
He is the handyman who's retiring next week.
霍華？ 他是這裡的雜工，下星期退休

81
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:36,300
Everyone who lives here is kicking in $100 as a kind of a thank you.
這裡的住戶決定每人交1百元 感謝他多年來的辛勞

82
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,930
That's nice.
真有人情味 

83
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,690
Yeah. So, do you want to give me a check?
是啊，所以你想開支票還是…

84
00:05:43,970 --> 00:05:46,440
Not now. You can slip it under my door.
你不必現在給我 你可以塞進我家門口

85
00:05:46,710 --> 00:05:48,400
No,it's not that.
不是那樣的

86
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:51,310
I just moved in.
我才剛搬來

87
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:55,440
Well,the guy's worked here for 25 years.
他在這裡工作了25年

88
00:05:55,650 --> 00:05:58,210
Yes,but I've lived here for 25 minutes.
但我才搬進來25分鐘

90
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:04,110
Okay,I get it.
好，我懂了

91
00:06:04,490 --> 00:06:09,160
Wait! Look, I'm sorry, it's just I've never even met Howard.
等等，我很抱歉 但我甚至沒見過霍華

92
00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:11,800
I mean, I don't know Howard.
我不認識霍華 

93
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:14,660
Howard's the handyman.
霍華是雜務工人

94
00:06:15,770 --> 00:06:19,600
Yes,but to me,he's just "man."
但對我來說他只是個人

95
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:23,240
Okay. Fine. Whatever.
好，隨便

96
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:25,950
Welcome to the building.
歡迎你搬進來

97
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:30,640
Can you believe that guy?
真是有夠扯的

98
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:33,250
I really like his glasses.
是啊，我很喜歡他的眼鏡

99
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:42,030
So then President Steve told everyone I was a cheapskate...
史提夫主席逢人就說我吝嗇 

100
00:06:42,330 --> 00:06:44,300
...and now the whole building hates me.
現在整棟樓的人都討厭我

101
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:46,990
A little kid spit on my knee.
有小孩朝我的膝蓋吐口水

102
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:51,200
And told me to wipe it off with my $100 bill.
還叫我用百元大鈔去擦

103
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:54,810
You really should wipe it off with something.
你是該擦一下

104
00:06:57,510 --> 00:06:58,500
You know what?
你們猜怎樣？

105
00:06:58,750 --> 00:07:01,980
I'll throw a party. For everyone in the building.
我要辦一場派對 邀請整棟樓的人

106
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:07,150
And I'll sit them all down and explain that I am not a bad guy.
我要請他們坐下，告訴他們 我不是壞人

107
00:07:07,390 --> 00:07:10,190
I am not a cheap guy. I'm just a guy...
不是吝嗇 我只是個...

108
00:07:10,460 --> 00:07:12,690
...who stands up for what he believes in.
...堅持理念 

109
00:07:13,030 --> 00:07:15,430
A man with principles.
有原則的人

110
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,430
Sounds like a fun party.
聽起來真好玩

111
00:07:19,530 --> 00:07:23,200
If you want them to like you, why don't you just pay the $100?
羅斯，如果你希望鄰居喜歡你 為什麼不付錢算了？

112
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,170
The party will cost you more.
辦一場派對更花錢

113
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,670
That doesn't matter!
那不重要

114
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:30,640
It's my principles! We're talking about my principles!
這是原則問題 重點是我的原則

115
00:07:31,050 --> 00:07:34,280
I thought it was about your neighbors liking you.
好，我以為重點是討鄰居喜歡

116
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:38,350
They'll like me once they come to my awesome party.
等他們參加過我的派對 就會喜歡我了

117
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,950
I gotta get some nametags.
我得走了，我要去買名牌

118
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:49,400
And that crazy party animal will be your brother-in-law.
那個派對動物會是你的大舅子

119
00:07:51,030 --> 00:07:53,500
Very funny. But don't say that to Monica.
真幽默，但別對著摩妮卡講 

120
00:07:53,730 --> 00:07:55,960
Don't put any ideas in her head.
別讓她有那些念頭

121
00:07:56,470 --> 00:08:00,910
You do realize that those ideas are probably already in Monica's head?
錢德，你應該知道 她可能本來就有那種念頭了

122
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:03,040
Why?
為什麼？

123
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:08,210
Well,because she loves you and because you love her.
因為她愛你，你也愛她

124
00:08:08,550 --> 00:08:10,810
Yeah,so? What's that supposed to mean?
那又怎樣呢？

125
00:08:11,750 --> 00:08:15,590
Don't freak out! I'm telling you something you already know.
你不要被嚇到 我只是在講你知道的事

126
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:18,950
She left Richard because he didn't want to have babies.
她因理查不要小孩而跟他分手

127
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:24,030
And she is a woman. And she's almost 30. And, you know, it's Monica.
她是個女人，快30了 而且她是摩妮卡

128
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:26,890
I don't see it that way. I see two Monicas.
我不是那樣看的 我看到兩個摩妮卡

129
00:08:27,170 --> 00:08:30,760
My friend who lives across the hall and wants a lot of babies.
朋友的摩妮卡住在對面 想生一大堆小孩

130
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:34,170
And the new Monica who I started to date.
另一個新的摩妮卡剛跟我交往

131
00:08:34,410 --> 00:08:37,240
Now,who is to say what she wants?
誰曉得她想要什麼？

132
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,770
I'm right.
我說得沒錯

133
00:08:40,350 --> 00:08:41,780
Am I right?
我說得沒錯吧？

134
00:08:43,550 --> 00:08:44,980
Oh,absolutely.
當然 

135
00:08:45,150 --> 00:08:47,120
I'm completely different from Richard.
而且情況完全不同

136
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:50,520
He's an eye doctor, and I don't wear glasses.
理查是眼科醫生 我連眼鏡都沒戴

137
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,050
You're right.
你說得對

138
00:08:54,430 --> 00:08:58,060
You're absolutely right. That makes everything different.
你說得一點也沒錯 情況確實完全不同

139
00:08:59,430 --> 00:09:00,760
It's not different,is it?
一點也沒有不同對吧？ 

140
00:09:01,070 --> 00:09:03,200
Not unless different means "the same."
除非不同等於一樣

141
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:09,370
You were so funny with that waiter. You're such a nut!
你跟那個服務生好逗喔 你真是個瘋子

142
00:09:15,250 --> 00:09:18,220
You know,bread-stick fangs are always funny.
扮吸血鬼本來就好笑

143
00:09:18,450 --> 00:09:21,550
No,you make them funny. You're the funny one!
是你讓它變好笑的，是你好笑

144
00:09:24,590 --> 00:09:27,720
Look,Katie. Listen, we need to talk, okay?
凱蒂，我們得溝通一下

145
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:32,020
Look,I like you. I really do. I like you a lot.
我喜歡你，我真的很喜歡你

146
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:36,470
But sometimes when you playfully punch me like that...
但當你開玩笑打我

147
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:41,900
...it feels like I'm being hit with a very tiny but a very real bat!
感覺就像被一根很小 但很結實的球棒打到

148
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:46,580
Like I could hurt you.
我哪能把你打痛 

149
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:48,650
Are you making fun of my size?
你在取笑我的身材嗎？

150
00:09:48,880 --> 00:09:52,820
Don't make fun of me because of my size!
不要取笑我的身材

151
00:09:58,290 --> 00:10:00,060
Isn't this great?
這種感覺真好

152
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:03,390
Couldn't you just stay like this forever?
真想永遠這樣

154
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,170
Couldn't you just stay here forever?
錢德？你想不想永遠這樣？

155
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:14,240
Yeah, here, somewhere else. You know,wherever.
這樣，那樣，哪樣都可以

156
00:10:15,510 --> 00:10:16,500
Are you okay?
你還好嗎？ 

157
00:10:17,010 --> 00:10:18,140
I'm cool.
我很好

158
00:10:18,450 --> 00:10:19,810
Casual.
很隨性

159
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:22,080
What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？

160
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:26,820
Just hanging out. Having fun with the girl that I'm seeing casually.
只是隨便混混玩玩 跟你隨性的交往

161
00:10:28,590 --> 00:10:31,150
Man,I knew it! I knew you'd do this.
我就知道，我就知道你會這樣

162
00:10:31,330 --> 00:10:32,310
What?
怎樣？ 

163
00:10:32,490 --> 00:10:36,090
Get all freaked out because everybody was joking about marriage!
被大家討論和開玩笑的事嚇到

164
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:39,760
Well,you do want all that stuff,right?
你的確想要那些事吧？ 

165
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,470
You know what I want?
你知道我想要什麼？

166
00:10:41,670 --> 00:10:44,640
Yes! You want babies! You have baby fever!
沒錯，你想要小孩 你有孩子狂

167
00:10:46,110 --> 00:10:47,800
I do not have baby fever!
我才沒有孩子狂

168
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:50,880
You're obsessed with babies and marriage...
拜託，你超迷戀小孩和婚姻

169
00:10:51,180 --> 00:10:54,670
...and everything that's related to babies and marriage.
和一切跟小孩和婚姻有關的事

170
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:59,540
Why don't we turn the heat down on this pressure cooker!
我有個提議 讓這個壓力鍋減壓一下吧

171
00:11:01,020 --> 00:11:02,820
Have you lost your mind?
你瘋了嗎？

172
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:07,290
This isn't about me. This is about you and your weird commitment crap!
這不是我的問題 是你不敢做出承諾

173
00:11:07,530 --> 00:11:11,990
I know you. I know the thoughts that you have in your head.
少來，我暸解你 我知道你腦袋裡在想什麼

174
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:14,370
You don't know everything.
你並非什麼都知道

175
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:18,070
Did you know I'm going out with Rachel tonight instead of you?
你知道我今晚要跟瑞秋出去嗎

176
00:11:18,310 --> 00:11:20,360
And that the only baby here is you?
你知道最幼稚的是你嗎？

177
00:11:20,570 --> 00:11:23,670
Did you know I can't even look at you now?
你知道我連看都不想看你嗎？

178
00:11:26,210 --> 00:11:27,370
I did not know that.
那我倒是不知道

179
00:11:33,050 --> 00:11:37,120
It'll be okay, right? She won't leave me. This is fixable.
不會有事吧？她不會離開我吧 這是可以解決的

180
00:11:37,390 --> 00:11:39,380
-Yeah,sure. -Absolutely.
當然

181
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:40,720
By me?
我可以解決?

182
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:47,570
Unless you make some big gesture.
除非你有大動作 

183
00:11:47,740 --> 00:11:48,720
Big,though.
要非常大

184
00:11:50,500 --> 00:11:51,490
The missus!
女主角來了

185
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:55,740
Gunther, can I get a coffee?
阿甘，我要一杯咖啡

186
00:11:56,910 --> 00:11:57,900
To go.
外帶

187
00:11:59,750 --> 00:12:01,680
I still don't want to talk to you.
我還不想跟你說話

188
00:12:01,980 --> 00:12:04,250
Tell me how to make things right.
告訴我怎樣彌補

189
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,250
That's what we do.
什麼？ 我們都這樣

190
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:09,510
I mess up,you tell me how to fix it and I do.
我做錯事 你教我怎麼補救，我補救完 

192
00:12:09,790 --> 00:12:12,190
And then you think I'm cute again.
你又覺得我很可愛

193
00:12:13,830 --> 00:12:16,820
I'm really tired of being your relationship tutor.
我不想再當你的愛情指導了 

194
00:12:17,030 --> 00:12:19,000
Figure this out for yourself.
這次你得自己想，好嗎？

195
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:22,760
If you're afraid of a real relationship...
如果你懶得好好經營感情 

196
00:12:22,970 --> 00:12:24,940
...then don't be in one.
就別談感情

197
00:12:36,956 --> 00:12:39,288
（歡迎）

198
00:12:49,168 --> 00:12:51,102
（羅斯）

199
00:12:54,039 --> 00:12:55,700
（蓋勒博士）

200
00:13:03,010 --> 00:13:05,670
Howard! Howard! Howard!
霍華、霍華…

201
00:13:15,761 --> 00:13:18,025
菲比？菲比

202
00:13:18,190 --> 00:13:20,020
Hi,Ross!
羅斯

203
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:22,730
What are you doing here?
你在幹什麼？

204
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:26,660
I thought this was your party, and it's a party for Howard.
我以為這是你的派對 結果是替霍華辦的派對

205
00:13:26,900 --> 00:13:28,870
He's the sweetest little man.
他真是個老可愛

206
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,940
See you,Phoebe. And thanks for chipping in.
菲比再見，謝謝你出錢 

207
00:13:33,210 --> 00:13:34,610
Oh,sure.
不客氣

208
00:13:35,510 --> 00:13:37,030
You chipped in?
你出了錢？ 

209
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,730
Yeah,$100.
對，1百塊錢

210
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:41,910
I can't believe you gave him money.
你居然給他們錢

211
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:46,380
I thought you agreed it was unreasonable that they asked me for that money.
你不是也同意他們要我出錢 是很不合理的？

212
00:13:46,590 --> 00:13:47,880
But they didn't ask me.
對，但他們沒有要我出

213
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:52,720
I'm just the exotic,generous stranger. That's always fun to be.
當性感大方的陌生人最好玩了

214
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:55,550
But you're making me look bad.
但你讓我很難看

215
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:58,930
No,I'm not! If anything, I'm making you look better.
誰說的，我是在幫你加分

216
00:13:59,130 --> 00:14:02,530
They'll see you talking to me. I'm a hit.
他們會看見你在跟我說話 我又很紅

217
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:05,200
Hey,Phoebe!
菲比

218
00:14:05,470 --> 00:14:07,030
Hey,Ross.
羅斯，

219
00:14:07,370 --> 00:14:09,600
Maybe you two could switch apartments.
你們或許可以交換住處

220
00:14:09,810 --> 00:14:12,440
Because Phoebe is more our kind of people.
菲比跟我們比較搭軋

221
00:14:12,710 --> 00:14:13,940
Think about it.
你考慮一下

222
00:14:17,750 --> 00:14:19,450
Okay,my bad.
是我不好

223
00:14:35,740 --> 00:14:38,100
You look big.
哇，你看起來好壯

224
00:14:38,510 --> 00:14:40,470
Thanks,I've been working out.
謝謝，最近有在練

225
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:44,240
Listen,is it obvious I'm wearing six sweaters?
看得出來我穿六件毛衣嗎？

227
00:14:46,850 --> 00:14:49,010
Yeah. But it's not obvious why.
看得出來，但看不出來為什麼

228
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:52,950
I'm breaking up with Katie, so I put on some extra padding.
我要跟凱蒂分手 所以得多加幾層護墊

229
00:14:53,150 --> 00:14:57,350
If she hits me when she is happy, can you imagine how hard she'll hit...
她平常高興就會打我 現在我要收回喬伊之愛

231
00:14:57,590 --> 00:15:00,120
...when I take away the Joey love?
她豈不是打得更用力？

232
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:04,990
Oh,right. I forgot that you call it that.
我都忘記你的喬伊之愛了

233
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:11,900
Hey,cute jacket.
好可愛的外套

234
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:13,630
Thanks.
謝謝

235
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:16,070
-That's so sweet! -Ouch!
你真好

236
00:15:20,050 --> 00:15:24,450
Did Joey tell you to say that? You guys are too much!
是喬伊要你叫的嗎？ 你們真是夠了

237
00:15:26,490 --> 00:15:28,960
You know what? I gotta tell you...
你知道嗎？說真的 

238
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:31,890
...I think you're the one that is too much.
我覺得你才夠了

239
00:15:33,930 --> 00:15:36,230
Joey has the nicest friends.
喬伊的朋友真棒

240
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,470
And the nicest girlfriend.
女朋友更棒

241
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,900
You're so sweet!
你真好

242
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:46,000
You're so sweet!
你才好

244
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:55,410
She just kicked me.
喬伊，她踢我

245
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:02,780
Aren't you going to do something?
你不替我出頭嗎？

246
00:16:04,260 --> 00:16:07,090
Do something or I'll walk out that door right now.
你最好替我出頭 否則我現在就走人

247
00:16:09,500 --> 00:16:11,020
Are you going to?
你要不要？

248
00:16:12,638 --> 00:16:13,730
不要

249
00:16:27,686 --> 00:16:28,710
Phoebe?
菲比

250
00:16:28,821 --> 00:16:30,618
That's what I'm saying.
我就是這個意思

251
00:16:30,723 --> 00:16:32,020
Phoebe? Phoebe?
菲比？菲比

252
00:16:33,190 --> 00:16:36,380
This is a disaster. Can't I please just go?
這真是人間地獄 我走了好不好？

253
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:38,390
I'm talking you up to people.
不行，我正在幫你說好話

254
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:41,290
Give it some time, relax. Get something to eat.
再等一下下 放輕鬆，拿東西吃，好嗎？

255
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,870
What did you tell them about me?
你跟他們說了什麼？

256
00:16:48,140 --> 00:16:51,630
I told them about you and Emily. Trying to get some sympathy.
我說了你和艾蜜莉的事 好爭取同情心

257
00:16:51,910 --> 00:16:54,000
But you came off as the bad guy.
但講一講你成了壞人

258
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:57,340
Yeah, I think I told it wrong.
我想我說的方式不對

259
00:16:58,850 --> 00:17:03,180
We should talk about that because I don't understand what happened there.
我們應該先聊聊 我不太知道前因後果

260
00:17:05,690 --> 00:17:07,240
This cake is really good!
這個蛋糕真好吃

261
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:09,490
Things are looking up.
看吧？情況已經在好轉了

262
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:14,060
Oh,my God! Someone cut Howard's cake!
天哪，有人切了霍華的蛋糕

263
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:20,260
Who would do a thing like that?
誰會做這種低級的事？

264
00:17:26,170 --> 00:17:27,370
3B.
3B

265
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:32,610
You got your free food. You ruined everyone's fun.
你白吃白喝，掃了大家的興 

266
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,580
Isn't it time you went home?
是不是該回家了？

267
00:17:34,620 --> 00:17:36,581
Yeah, get out! Now!
沒錯，快滾

268
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:39,450
Go back to 3B,3B.
回3B去，3B

269
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:44,390
Everyone,calm down! I have something that I'd like to say.
大家安靜一下，我有話要說

270
00:17:47,130 --> 00:17:48,750
Who here likes Ross?
這裡有誰喜歡羅斯？

271
00:17:53,970 --> 00:17:55,530
Of course you don't like him.
你們當然不喜歡他

272
00:17:55,770 --> 00:17:57,530
He didn't give you any money.
他不交錢 

273
00:17:57,870 --> 00:18:01,200
He raised his own hand when I asked, "Who likes Ross?"
我問有誰喜歡他，他自己舉手

274
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,540
And he's wearing two nametags.
他還貼兩個名牌

275
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:10,820
I'll be honest. When I first met Ross, I didn't like him at all.
老實說，剛開始我也不喜歡他

276
00:18:13,050 --> 00:18:16,420
Once I got to know him, I saw that he is really sweet...
但暸解他之後 我就發現他很好...

277
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:20,060
...and caring and very generous.
...很大方

278
00:18:20,290 --> 00:18:24,090
All I'm saying is,don't judge Ross before you get to know him.
請不要還不暸解他就論斷他

279
00:18:24,330 --> 00:18:29,230
You know,I like all of you guys now. But when I first met you, you know?
我現在很喜歡你們 但是剛見面時

280
00:18:29,470 --> 00:18:31,770
Kurt? I thought, abrasive drunk.
寇特，粗魯的酒鬼

281
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:35,130
Lola?
蘿拉

282
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,600
Mind-numbingly stupid.
笨得令人傻眼

283
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:43,610
You guys. Gold digger, cradle-robbing perv.
還有你們 淘金女，老牛吃嫩草的變態

284
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:49,120
So I think you all know what I mean.
你們懂我的意思吧

285
00:18:55,630 --> 00:18:58,620
Obviously, I didn't think they would throw things.
我沒想到他們會扔東西

286
00:19:00,370 --> 00:19:03,700
I thought if I kept insulting them you'd defend them.
我想說我一直羞辱他們 你就會跳出來幫他們

287
00:19:03,940 --> 00:19:05,930
Then you'd look like the hero.
你就可以變成英雄 對喔

288
00:19:08,780 --> 00:19:10,540
See,I did not get that.
太深奧了

289
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:18,140
Where's Monica? I need to talk to her, it's urgent.
摩妮卡呢？我有急事找她 她在嗎？

290
00:19:18,950 --> 00:19:20,180
I'm Monica.
我就是摩妮卡

291
00:19:20,390 --> 00:19:22,480
I need to talk to you. It's urgent.
我有急事要找你 好

292
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:25,190
I've been thinking...
我想了很多...

293
00:19:25,490 --> 00:19:29,190
...about us. A lot of "us" thinking.
我們的事… 你和我的事

294
00:19:30,900 --> 00:19:33,530
I guess there's only one way to do this.
我猜只有一個辦法

295
00:19:38,170 --> 00:19:39,570
What are you doing?
你要幹什麼？

296
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:41,970
Don't do it.
摩妮卡… 拜託不要

297
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:43,740
Will you marry me?
你願意嫁給我嗎？

298
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:50,080
What a bad idea.
毀了 什麼餿主意

299
00:19:50,350 --> 00:19:52,320
I can't not look at it.
我不敢看

300
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:56,220
Why are you doing this?
錢德，你為什麼要這樣？ 

301
00:19:56,490 --> 00:19:57,920
I don't know.
我不知道

302
00:19:58,590 --> 00:20:01,030
But I know I'm not afraid to do this.
但是我知道我不怕

303
00:20:03,230 --> 00:20:05,720
I'm doing this because I'm sorry?
錢德 因為我很抱歉？

304
00:20:08,070 --> 00:20:12,400
Do you think the best reason to get married is because you're sorry?
你真的覺得結婚的最好理由 是因為你很抱歉？

305
00:20:12,610 --> 00:20:14,540
The best reason is pregnancy.
不，最好的理由是奉子成婚

306
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:23,180
Sorry is fourth,behind being ready and actually wanting to get married.
抱歉大約排第四 在準備好了跟真的想結婚後面

307
00:20:23,580 --> 00:20:25,580
Will you be my wife?
你願意做我的妻子嗎？

308
00:20:29,190 --> 00:20:33,630
I want you to take a minute and think about how ridiculous this sounds.
錢德，你先靜下來 想想這件事有多荒謬

309
00:20:37,430 --> 00:20:40,060
I'm kind of wishing everyone wasn't here now.
我的確有點希望他們都不在

310
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:44,900
None of that came from me.
這些事都不是我扯出來的 

311
00:20:45,140 --> 00:20:48,700
I never said I wanted to have babies and get married!
我從來沒說現在就想結婚生子

312
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:52,140
I was really confused. Then I talked to these guys.
但我真的很亂 後來又跟他們談過

313
00:20:52,410 --> 00:20:54,710
Who? Two divorces and Joey?
離婚兩次的人和喬伊？

314
00:20:56,720 --> 00:20:58,240
She's right,you know?
她說得對

315
00:20:59,890 --> 00:21:02,790
Yeah,but still, cheap shot!
但這種奚落算什麼？

316
00:21:04,630 --> 00:21:07,460
You know when I said that I want you...
你知道嗎？ 

317
00:21:07,730 --> 00:21:10,790
...to deal with relationship stuff all on your own?
我不是要你自己想該怎麼做?

318
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,230
You're not ready.
你還做不到這一點 

319
00:21:12,900 --> 00:21:14,660
I didn't think I was!
我也這麼認為

320
00:21:19,610 --> 00:21:20,600
Oh,my God.
天哪

321
00:21:21,140 --> 00:21:23,770
What would you have done if I had said yes?
要是我答應了呢？

322
00:21:24,010 --> 00:21:25,950
I would've been happy because...
那我會很開心 

323
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:29,910
...I would spend the rest of my life with the woman I love.
能跟心愛的人共度下半生

324
00:21:31,150 --> 00:21:34,450
Or you would have seen a Chandler-shaped hole in that door.
又或者你會在那扇門上 看到我的人形洞

325
00:21:39,490 --> 00:21:40,930
Will you pass that knife?
羅斯，請把刀子給我 

326
00:21:41,230 --> 00:21:42,920
No,I will not.
我才不要

327
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:45,390
You don't have to be mean about it.
你不必這麼凶吧

328
00:21:45,730 --> 00:21:48,700
You're right. I'm sorry. Will you marry me?
你說得對，對不起 嫁給我好嗎？

329
00:21:52,540 --> 00:21:57,000
I was going to ask you to marry me because I didn't say hello to you.
我正想向你求婚 因為我上星期忘了跟你打招呼

330
00:21:58,250 --> 00:22:02,080
Or ask them to move in with you. But I'm not sure. Chandler?
那種情況應該只需要同居 但我也不確定，錢德？

331
00:22:03,250 --> 00:22:04,740
How long is this going to go on?
好，我還要被笑多久？

332
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:07,010
I think the length of teasing...
那得看...

333
00:22:07,220 --> 00:22:11,590
...is directly related to how insane you were. So a long time.
...你做的事有多扯 所以…會很久

334
00:22:12,230 --> 00:22:13,210
This is fun!
真好玩 

335
00:22:13,560 --> 00:22:15,890
Remember that "we were on a break" thing?
記得「我們分手了」風波嗎？

336
00:22:16,130 --> 00:22:18,290
I'm sorry. Will you marry me?
我很抱歉，嫁給我好嗎？

337
00:22:23,940 --> 00:22:25,370
That's not funny.
不好笑 冷死了

338
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


339
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
